Copyright 2026 Domingo Moreno / DoTwo

Original concept and project direction: Domingo Moreno / DoTwo.

This project provides a local VTR-style playback workflow for audiovisual labs:
copying media to local staging, normalizing videos/images for reliable playback,
and sending a clean output window to a second display.

Initial implementation and tooling were developed with OpenClaw/Bender
assistance.

